"icon": "res://content/characters/fadeaway/fadeaway_icon_h.png",
"note": "pass 143: The Robot (Garry: \"a head of a robot bull and ... Chicago Bulls red basketball uniform. Without any of the Chicago Bulls symbols\"): a lean robot of dark gunmetal metal with a robot bull's head (two off-white horns, amber eyes, a nose ring) in a red jersey and shorts with black and white trim, the 88 on the chest and the back; Klein edits of FAD-E's paintings view by view (the front an edit of FAD-E's front, so his build, height and pose stay; tools/dl/p143/ROBOT/scripts/fronts.py, views.py), walked on FAD-E's puppet walk (fadeaway_puppet_run_up) at FAD-E's run_scale, polished (the blue screen's fringes and a green cast to grey); the badge a two-reference edit of FAD-E's badge painting (fadeaway_portrait_p143_c1, framed by portrait_badge with the horns' span 0.72 of the badge hung 0.10 from the top so both horns show), the title an edit of hero_fadeaway_c.png (fadeaway_title_p143_c1, the ball at his hip)",
"shelved": true,
