"icon": "res://content/characters/fadeaway/fadeaway_icon_i.png",
"note": "pass 147: the bull basketball player (Garry: \"a robot, a basketball player a bull ... doesn't look like either\": now a bull and a basketball player, nothing metal): the puppet method on the textured 3D model bull_basketball.glb (Hunyuan3D from Garry's picture), rigged with Mixamo bones from his T-pose (tools/dl/p147/ROBOT/scripts/rig_bull.py), walked on Mixamo's \"mutant walking\" (creature_walk, in place, his own rest directions kept) and a standing idle from the mutant's breathing idle; the stills are Klein paintings of renders of the textured model in each view (green screen: the blue one keyed his white trim away; the side by img2img from its render, the fd and the dead from the style anchor and the render, the hurts edited from the painted views; tools/dl/p147/ROBOT/scripts/stills.py), walked on the puppet's depth guides (fadeaway_bull_creature_walk_depth, Wan 2.2 Fun Control) sized by the puppet's silhouette (run_fit), polished (the green screen's fringes to slate); wider than the other outlaws by design",
"shelved": false,
